    <string name="about_sources_title">Where every fact comes from</string>
    <string name="about_sources_body">Each rule comes from an official source, such as the exam body, the regulator or the board, and a person checks it against that document before it reaches your phone. Every one shows its source and when it was last checked.</string>
    <string name="about_never_title">What we never do</string>
    <string name="about_never_body">We take no money from colleges or coaching centres, show no sponsored listings, and never sell or share what you tell us. We never recommend a college you did not ask about.</string>
    <string name="about_phone_title">Your answers stay here</string>
    <string name="about_phone_body">There is no account. What you tell us is stored on this phone and used only to check each rule against your situation.</string>
    <string name="about_cutoffs_title">What we will not promise</string>
    <string name="about_cutoffs_body">Past cutoffs are trends, not promises. When we do not have a verified fact, we say so instead of guessing.</string>
